# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
# 不加前导斜杠：匹配任意层级的 build/，覆盖 packages/*/build/
# （packages/home、packages/login 由 flutter create 生成了各自的 .gitignore，
#   手工创建的 packages/ui_kit 没有，曾导致构建产物被误纳入版本控制）
build/
coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/
